golden_2026.csv: purchase prices hand-computed for spec 009 (AC-009-04) from the 2026 tariffs that URE
approved on 2025-12-17 (seller and DSO tariffs of Enea, Energa, PGE and Tauron; pages in
config/tariffs/2026) and the national components in config/tariffs/2026/national.yaml. Official tariffs
are public documents; only their rates are reproduced.
